1. System Architecture
FitBuddy-AI can follow a three-layer architecture:

┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
│          PRESENTATION LAYER         │
│        React / Next.js UI           │
│                                     │
│ Login │ Profile │ Workout │ Progress│
└──────────────────┬──────────────────┘
                   │
                   ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
│          APPLICATION LAYER          │
│           Node.js Backend           │
│                                     │
│ Auth │ Plan Generator │ Tracking    │
│ Validation │ AI Assistant           │
└──────────────┬───────────┬──────────┘
               │           │
               ▼           ▼
       ┌────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐
       │  Database  │  │ Gemini API   │
       │            │  │             │
       │ Users      │  │ Plan        │
       │ Workouts   │  │ Generation  │
       │ Progress   │  │ Adaptation  │
       └────────────┘  └─────────────┘

2. Main System Modules
1. Authentication Module
Responsible for:

Registration

Login

Logout

User authentication

Profile management

2. Fitness Assessment Module
Collects:

Age

Height/weight

Fitness level

Fitness goal

Available equipment

Workout days

Workout duration

Preferences

3. AI Plan Generator
This is the core module.

User Profile
     ↓
Validate Input
     ↓
Build Gemini Prompt
     ↓
Gemini API
     ↓
Structured JSON
     ↓
Validate Response
     ↓
Save Workout Plan

4. Workout Module
Displays:

Today's workout

Exercise list

Sets

Repetitions

Rest time

Exercise instructions

Warm-up/cooldown

5. Progress Module
Tracks:

Completed workouts

Workout frequency

Workout history

Progress metrics

Weekly activity

6. AI Assistant Module
Allows users to interact naturally with FitBuddy-AI.

Example:

User:
"I don't have a bench today."

             ↓

        Gemini AI

             ↓

"Try these alternative exercises..."

