4. Gemini Integration Design
The backend should communicate with Gemini rather than exposing the API key in the frontend.

React
  │
  │ POST /api/generate-plan
  ▼
Backend
  │
  ├── Validate user input
  │
  ├── Construct prompt
  │
  ▼
Gemini
  │
  ▼
Structured JSON
  │
  ├── Validate schema
  │
  ├── Store in database
  │
  ▼
Frontend

Google's Gemini API supports structured output with JSON schemas, which fits this architecture well because the frontend can consume predictable workout objects instead of parsing arbitrary model-generated text.

