9. Security Design
The design should include:

Server-side Gemini API key storage

Password hashing

Authentication tokens/session management

Input validation

Authorization checks

Database access controls

Protection of personal information

Validation of Gemini responses before storing/displaying them

The Gemini API key should never be embedded directly in frontend JavaScript.

